{
  "file": "Recommendations",
  "page": 16,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51919937133789,
        42.10532760620117,
        195.8612060546875,
        51.10532760620117
      ],
      "text": "1.6 STRENGTH OF RECOMMENDATIONS",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53719711303711,
        60.276031494140625,
        399.5582580566406,
        69.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "A judgement about the strength of the recommendations was based on the quality of the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.38419723510742,
        72.27304077148438,
        399.6032409667969,
        81.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "evidence, values, costs and opinions about trade-offs between beneﬁt and harm. The group",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.429195404052734,
        84.27005004882812,
        399.6029052734375,
        93.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "graded the strength of each recommendation to reﬂect the degree of conﬁdence that the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.43819808959961,
        96.26705932617188,
        399.57586669921875,
        105.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "desirable effects of adherence to the recommendation would outweigh the undesirable",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.411197662353516,
        108.26406860351562,
        400.12591552734375,
        117.27597045898438
      ],
      "text": "effects. Although degree of conﬁdence is necessarily a continuum, we used two categories:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.49300003051758,
        120.27297973632812,
        399.7026672363281,
        129.27297973632812
      ],
      "text": "strong and conditional. The quality of the evidence was assessed according to the GRADE",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53799819946289,
        132.26998901367188,
        91.71399688720703,
        141.26998901367188
      ],
      "text": "method (12).",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53799819946289,
        150.26998901367188,
        399.9456481933594,
        159.26998901367188
      ],
      "text": "‘Moderate’ quality of evidence indicates that the estimate of an effect of the intervention",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.77199935913086,
        162.26699829101562,
        400.5130920410156,
        171.26699829101562
      ],
      "text": "might be uncertain, and further research may affect conﬁdence in the estimate while ‘low’",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.70000076293945,
        174.26400756835938,
        399.6705322265625,
        183.27603149414062
      ],
      "text": "quality of evidence suggests that the estimate of the effect is highly uncertain, and further",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50568771362305,
        186.27304077148438,
        400.1116943359375,
        195.27304077148438
      ],
      "text": "research is likely to affect conﬁdence in the estimate. In contrast, for high-quality evidence,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.49668502807617,
        198.27005004882812,
        323.2156066894531,
        207.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "further research is unlikely to change conﬁdence in the estimated effect.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.51468276977539,
        216.27005004882812,
        399.6614990234375,
        225.27005004882812
      ],
      "text": "A strong recommendation indicates that the desirable effects of adherence to the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.49668502807617,
        228.26705932617188,
        400.3184814453125,
        237.26705932617188
      ],
      "text": "recommendation clearly outweigh the undesirable effects. The words ‘should’ or ‘should not’",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50568771362305,
        240.26406860351562,
        399.7068176269531,
        249.2730712890625
      ],
      "text": "are used in strong recommendations. No alternatives are listed. A conditional recommendation",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53268814086914,
        252.27008056640625,
        399.6810302734375,
        261.27294921875
      ],
      "text": "indicates that the desirable effects of adherence to the recommendation probably outweigh",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.50710678100586,
        264.26995849609375,
        399.7259826660156,
        273.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "the undesirable effects, but the trade-offs are uncertain. Reasons for lack of certainty include:",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.56110763549805,
        282.26995849609375,
        291.4830627441406,
        291.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "• lack of high-quality evidence to support the recommendation,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.57011032104492,
        300.26995849609375,
        253.13400268554688,
        309.26995849609375
      ],
      "text": "• few beneﬁts of implementing the recommendation,",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5791130065918,
        318.26995849609375,
        205.19113159179688,
        327.2789611816406
      ],
      "text": "• the beneﬁts may not justify the costs or",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52512741088867,
        336.2758483886719,
        279.2508544921875,
        345.2789611816406
      ],
      "text": "• it was not possible to arrive at precise estimates of beneﬁt.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.53279495239258,
        354.2758483886719,
        358.00970458984375,
        363.2758483886719
      ],
      "text": "Conditional recommendations contain the word ‘may’. Alternatives may be listed.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5507926940918,
        372.2758483886719,
        401.4793701171875,
        381.2758483886719
      ],
      "text": "Table 1 shows the differences between strong and conditional recommendations in terms",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.3527946472168,
        384.2728576660156,
        399.5174255371094,
        393.2728576660156
      ],
      "text": "of both wording and the factors used to judge their strength. Strong and conditional",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.3527946472168,
        396.2698669433594,
        399.5625,
        405.2698669433594
      ],
      "text": "recommendations have different implications for policy-makers, patients and health care",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5237922668457,
        408.2757568359375,
        224.76377868652344,
        417.27587890625
      ],
      "text": "providers; these are also summarized in Table 1.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.531803131103516,
        426.2757568359375,
        401.685546875,
        435.2757568359375
      ],
      "text": "In this document recommendations 1, 3, 4, and 5 are categorized as “strong” even though",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.55880355834961,
        438.27276611328125,
        401.66748046875,
        447.27276611328125
      ],
      "text": "the evidence is graded as “very low”. These recommendations are so categorized because",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.54080581665039,
        450.2697448730469,
        401.6407165527344,
        459.2697448730469
      ],
      "text": "the systematic reviews indicated beneﬁts with little potential harms, but there were no data",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.5138053894043,
        462.2667541503906,
        399.69677734375,
        471.2757568359375
      ],
      "text": "on alternative approaches, cost, or overall programmatic impact. Recommendation 2 was",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.52279281616211,
        474.2727355957031,
        399.62457275390625,
        483.2727355957031
      ],
      "text": "categorized as “conditional” based “very low” quality evidence because the studies cited in the",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.45978927612305,
        486.2697448730469,
        399.39044189453125,
        495.2697448730469
      ],
      "text": "systematic reviews, by-and-large, included only household contacts of sputum smear positive",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.22578811645508,
        498.2661437988281,
        399.9477233886719,
        507.2667541503906
      ],
      "text": "patients so the data do not directly relate to the contacts covered by the recommendation.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.404720306396484,
        510.2631530761719,
        399.60565185546875,
        519.26318359375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 6 is categorized as “conditional” with “very low” quality evidence because",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.44072341918945,
        522.2601928710938,
        399.6925964355469,
        531.2781372070312
      ],
      "text": "the existing data are very limited, but HIV testing of symptomatic persons is standard clinical",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.527896881103516,
        534.2706909179688,
        219.5939178466797,
        543.2706909179688
      ],
      "text": "practice, at least in high HIV prevalence areas.",
      "font": "TheSansSemiLight-Plain",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        217.77560424804688,
        651.97265625,
        224.43560791015625,
        659.47265625
      ],
      "text": "14",
      "font": "TheSansSemiBold-Plain",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}